      "parameters": {
        "width": 720,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## W22 Alerts (lean, 18 Oct 2026)\nIn: the n8n Error Trigger (every SMC workflow names smc-w22 as its error workflow) and signals from other workflows (Execute Workflow; contract in W22.md).\nEach signal becomes at most ONE alert per 24 h (signal_key|scope|severity, kept in this workflow's static data).\nOut: email to OPS_ALERT_EMAIL through smc-email-send (SortMyCover <hello@sortmycover.co.za>), every alert; WhatsApp ops_alert to OPS_WHATSAPP_JONATHAN (+ OPS_WHATSAPP_KG) through smc-whatsapp-send for red alerts, once TWILIO_CONTENT_SIDS has ops_alert.\nRed = a lead or booking workflow failed (W01-W07, W09, W10, W15, W28, WhatsApp Send, Email Verify) or a red producer signal. Amber = email only.\nLogic: automation/lib/w22.mjs. Generated by automation/build-w22.mjs; do not hand-edit."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w22n02",
      "name": "Any workflow failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "w22n03",
      "name": "Signal from another workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w22n04",
      "name": "Plan alerts (w22: normalise, 24 h dedupe, plan)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const L = require('lv-automation').w22;\n// 24-h dedupe in this workflow's static data (no ops schema): one alert per signal_key|scope|severity per day.\nconst sd = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst now = Date.now();\nconst env = { OPS_ALERT_EMAIL: $env.OPS_ALERT_EMAIL, OPS_WHATSAPP_JONATHAN: $env.OPS_WHATSAPP_JONATHAN, OPS_WHATSAPP_KG: $env.OPS_WHATSAPP_KG, TWILIO_CONTENT_SIDS: $env.TWILIO_CONTENT_SIDS };\nconst out = [];\nfor (const it of $input.all()) {\n  const s = L.normalise(it.json || {}, new Date(now).toISOString());\n  if (!s) continue;\n  const d = L.dedupe(sd.sent || {}, L.dedupeKey(s), now);\n  sd.sent = d.sent;\n  if (!d.send) continue;\n  for (const x of L.plan(s, env, now)) out.push({ json: x });\n}\nreturn out;"
      }
    },
